      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since it became impossible to Interact without fully pressing the trigger, I changed the threshold.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/trigger-thresholds-in-steamvr-bindings-are-too-high-since-input-system-update\n\nAs a result, on my VIVE controller, I cannot even grab, let alone pose. Please bind Interact and PhysBone grabbing to the same action, rather than Interact and PhysBone posing, as it was before.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
