      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm using Vive controllers, but is it because of this issue that I can't perform certain interactions with other people's avatars? For example, while others can grab and pull on an avatar's ears, all I can do is place my hand on it and lock its position by bending the bones. If I try to grasp the bones, it always fails.",
